{"kind": "addon", "id": 72, "name": "CAG Scribbles!", "slug": "cag-scribbles", "teaser": "Hand-drawn markings for the high speed PMC!", "owner_name": "Clacker", "downloads": 1815, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": null, "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T10:12:00.000000Z", "created_at": "2026-06-04T04:48:55.000000Z", "published_at": "2026-06-04T04:46:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": null, "latest_version": "1.2.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": null, "description_html": "<blockquote>\n<p><strong>This addon contains content with strong language</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>A collection of 60+ markings, symbols and more that I’ve recreated by hand from viewing photos of real life operator weapons and other video games (CoD 4, BF6 etc).</p>\n<p>I drew everything in the style of paint markers such as posca for a more fielded look.\nI’ll occasionally be updating this sticker pack as I see more cool markings and such overtime, I am also open to user suggestions.</p>\n<p>If you want to add more wear and tear to your markings, try using a mask texture.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>How to install</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>To install addon, drag and drop BepInEx folder into your SPT install directory.\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/afNPjAw.gif\" alt=\"Install\" title=\"Install\" /></p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": null, "content_length": 198297, "downloads": 156, "published_at": "2026-06-04T04:50:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/addon/download/72/cag-scribbles/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": null, "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.1.0", "spt_version_constraint": null, "content_length": 315376, "downloads": 123, "published_at": "2026-06-08T00